---
/**
 * Credentials page, diagram 1: where pncli keeps a token under the two storage
 * options — plaintext in ~/.pncli/config.json, or an OS-keychain reference.
 */
import '../styles/diagrams.css';
---

<figure class="not-prose my-8">
  <div class="overflow-x-auto">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 760 360" role="img" aria-labelledby="cs-title cs-desc" class="dg w-full min-w-[600px] h-auto">
      <title id="cs-title">Where pncli keeps a token</title>
      <desc id="cs-desc">
        Option A, the default: the token is written in plaintext in ~/.pncli/config.json and pncli reads it at startup.
        Option B, opt-in: config.json holds only a reference such as keychain:github.token; pncli asks the operating
        system's credential store for the secret over stdin. In both cases pncli sends the token to the service API
        in the Authorization header.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="cs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="cs-arrow-gold" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead-gold" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Panel A: plaintext -->
      <rect x="20" y="8" width="350" height="344" rx="12" class="dg-panel" />
      <text x="195" y="34" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-heading">A · Plaintext config (default)</text>
      <rect x="40" y="50" width="310" height="64" rx="10" class="dg-box" />
      <text x="195" y="75" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">~/.pncli/config.json</text>
      <text x="195" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono">"token": "ghp_…a1b2"</text>
      <line x1="195" y1="114" x2="195" y2="160" class="dg-line" marker-end="url(#cs-arrow)" />
      <text x="205" y="142" class="dg-label">read at startup</text>
      <rect x="115" y="162" width="160" height="48" rx="10" class="dg-box dg-strong" />
      <text x="195" y="191" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">pncli</text>
      <line x1="195" y1="210" x2="195" y2="256" class="dg-line" marker-end="url(#cs-arrow)" />
      <text x="205" y="238" class="dg-label">Authorization header</text>
      <rect x="40" y="258" width="310" height="48" rx="10" class="dg-box" />
      <text x="195" y="287" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Service API · GitHub, Jira, Bitbucket, …</text>
      <text x="195" y="334" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-warn">Anyone who can read the file can read the token</text>

      <!-- Panel B: OS keychain -->
      <rect x="390" y="8" width="350" height="344" rx="12" class="dg-panel" />
      <text x="565" y="34" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-heading">B · OS keychain (opt-in)</text>
      <rect x="410" y="50" width="310" height="64" rx="10" class="dg-box" />
      <text x="565" y="75" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">~/.pncli/config.json</text>
      <text x="565" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono">"token": "keychain:github.token"</text>
      <line x1="480" y1="114" x2="480" y2="160" class="dg-line" marker-end="url(#cs-arrow)" />
      <text x="490" y="142" class="dg-label">reference only</text>
      <rect x="410" y="162" width="140" height="48" rx="10" class="dg-box dg-strong" />
      <text x="480" y="191" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">pncli</text>
      <line x1="552" y1="186" x2="588" y2="186" class="dg-line dg-gold" marker-start="url(#cs-arrow-gold)" marker-end="url(#cs-arrow-gold)" />
      <text x="570" y="178" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-note">stdin</text>
      <rect x="590" y="146" width="130" height="84" rx="10" class="dg-box dg-accent" />
      <text x="655" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">OS store</text>
      <text x="655" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">macOS Keychain</text>
      <text x="655" y="204" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Credential Manager</text>
      <text x="655" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Secret Service</text>
      <line x1="480" y1="210" x2="480" y2="256" class="dg-line" marker-end="url(#cs-arrow)" />
      <text x="490" y="244" class="dg-label">Authorization header</text>
      <rect x="410" y="258" width="310" height="48" rx="10" class="dg-box" />
      <text x="565" y="287" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Service API · GitHub, Jira, Bitbucket, …</text>
      <text x="565" y="334" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-note">The file holds a pointer; the OS guards the secret</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/50 font-mono">
    Same command, same header — only where the secret rests changes. Move between A and B with <code>pncli config keychain migrate</code>.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
